  InitializationCommands "% Defaults: physical mode, snapshot of lib/parameters.py; lib/ctest.py pas"
"ses the current values as ModelVars.\n"
"Bench.Vdc = 400.0;\n"
"Bench.IF = 50.0;\n"
"Bench.Lload = 0.0001;\n"
"Bench.Ls_D = 1.54e-07;\n"
